WEBVTT

00:09:00.996 --> 00:09:02.676
And it has to happen now.

00:09:04.156 --> 00:09:05.716
In the Climate Justice Alliance,

00:09:05.716 --> 00:09:08.516
where I organize with thousands
of other frontline leaders,

00:09:08.556 --> 00:09:10.196
we're uniting ...

00:09:10.596 --> 00:09:11.756
for a transition.

00:09:11.796 --> 00:09:14.836
But not just any transition --
a just transition,

00:09:14.876 --> 00:09:18.156
away from a dig, burn, dump economy

00:09:19.236 --> 00:09:23.716
to one that is just
and clean for everyone.

00:09:24.836 --> 00:09:28.356
Reinvesting in local,
place-based solutions

00:09:28.396 --> 00:09:32.596
that are led by the very communities
with the very most at stake.